"lines": [
"Won 3 of 3 endpoints in 2 trials, allowing for the number each trial tested; 1 of 3 tested here from the posted counts, spread or interval, where the sponsor posted no test.",
"12.1 percentage points better than SoC EGFR-TKI on percentage of participants in progression free survival at 6, 12, in one trial of 78 weeks (95% interval 5.8 to 18.4)."
],
"notes": [
"Strength, how far past chance its average trial result is: z of 4.6 across 2 trials, where 1.96 is p = 0.05 and 3.29 (p = 0.001) scores 100.",
"Wins counted at 62 of 100, from 100: moved 68% of the way to the average of the drugs here (44), since its 2 trials say less on their own.",
"Every endpoint is against an active comparator.",
"1 result from trials of several doses: tested on all doses together, sized on the best dose, trimmed for having picked the best. Several doses against one placebo arm: the placebo is counted once.",
"3 posted endpoints not scored: no arm the book can read as its control (3)."
],
"size_basis": null,
"read_with_care": null
},
"safety": {
"score": 81.50489107274599,
