"serious": 65.57553768958687
},
"lines": [
"Serious adverse events: 1.9 points more than active comparators (29.0% against 27.1%), averaged across 2 of its 5 trials and 629 of 1,164 people treated (95% interval 8.4 fewer to 12.2 more)."
],
"notes": [
"Stopped for side effects: 4.5 points fewer than active comparators (14.3% against 18.8%), in 1 of its 5 trials and 350 of 1,164 people treated (95% interval 15.0 fewer to 6.0 more).",
"63% of the figure for serious adverse events rests on one trial (NCT02296125).",
"Stopped for side effects and serious adverse events count equally.",
"Counts are people with an event over each arm's whole follow-up; an arm followed for longer reports more.",
"Deaths, reported and not scored: 2.1 points fewer than control (60.9% against 63.1%) across 2 trials."
],
